0079 fit-content-lengths: A length may be CSS's fit-content(<length-percentage>), Length::FitContent and fit_content(): a measured element whose flex basis or size is one is measured with the limit as its definite available space, a fraction of its parent's definite size, so it can choose its width by the room it is given

